  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"buttons\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --btn: #0f3460;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-family: monospace;\n  margin: 16px 0 32px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.buttons {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  background: var(--btn);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 0;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 80px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--card);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\nbutton:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  #count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 14px;\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "let count = 0;\nconst countEl = document.getElementById('count');\nconst increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\nconst decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\nconst resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\nfunction updateDisplay() {\n  countEl.textContent = count;\n}\n\nincreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count += 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\ndecreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count -= 1;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nresetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  count = 0;\n  updateDisplay();\n});\n\nupdateDisplay();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA fully offline, pixel-style counter app built with HTML, CSS, and plain JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial count is `0`.\n- **Increase** button adds 1.\n- **Decrease** button subtracts 1 (supports negative numbers).\n- **Reset** button sets the count back to `0`.\n- The count is displayed in an `<output>` element with `id=\"count\"`.\n- Buttons have `id=\"increase\"`, `id=\"decrease\"`, and `id=\"reset\"`.\n- Keyboard accessible: all buttons are focusable and labeled with `aria-label`.\n- Responsive layout that works from 360px wide.\n- Cohesive 3–5 color palette with visible hover, focus, and pressed states.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use the keyboard (Tab to focus, Enter/Space to activate).\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `style.css` – pixel-style theme\n- `script.js` – counter logic\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No external assets, imports, or packages.\n- No `localStorage` or cookies.\n- No inline event handlers; uses `addEventListener`.\n- Total source under 200 lines.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
